{"bookId":"cp-5","editionId":"48cce4d1d7388361","chapterId":"c0005","paragraphs":[{"id":"pa7b3e7e9f2d6-1","text":"长飘泊，多愁多病心情恶"},{"id":"p177cd397372d-1","text":"心情恶"},{"id":"pe561affe4b7d-1","text":"模糊一片，强分哀乐"},{"id":"p17eae35a5ae3-1","text":"拟将欢笑排离索，镜中无奈颜非昨"},{"id":"pb27e2a845397-1","text":"颜非昨"},{"id":"pc8f149641327-1","text":"才华尚浅，因何福薄"}]}